# Winterspring - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Winterspring accept in the local census (48 quests, band 47-60,
# docs/winterspring-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 48 turnins
# close every record that has one in the data. The 16 repeatables (E'ko
# turn-ins, Rivern chain, Argent catalogue, Timbermaw tails, Making Amends),
# the 2 Lunar Festival elders, the 3 unplaced records (Pip, Human Remains,
# Awbee) and the 10 accepts contracted elsewhere (8 Felwood Timbermaw links,
# Stormwind Ka-Boom!) are out with reasons in the census; 7 Horde quests are
# set aside by ID for the Horde block. No race header and no race gates:
# nothing contracted is race-locked. Class gates: 5126 is
# Warrior/Paladin/Shaman-only. Profession lines ride optional + when-skill
# gates (Blacksmithing x6, Engineering x1). Ungateable outside pres (5103 for
# 5124, 5160 for 5161/5162) are structural notes; soft pres that turn in here
# (978, 979, 93197, 92008, 5250) ride dedicated when-onquest minis; cross-guide
# contracted pres (3908, 980, 4808, 5083, 5085, 5249, 5248, 6501) are reference
# notes. Dungeon-interior objectives (BRD x3, Sunken Temple, UBRS) have no data
# placement and ship as honest note-only namings, the BS-4241 precedent.
guide butler-routes-completionist/winterspring
title Winterspring
levels 47-60
zone Winterspring
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Everlook arrival - the Everlook Report

  zone map 1452

  tip Everlook is the hub: flight point, inn and the whole east-side cast below.
  accept 6028 -- The Everlook Report - Gregor Greystone (61.35, 38.97); for the Argent Officer Pureheart in the Eastern Plaguelands
  accept 6030 -- Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff - Gregor Greystone; for Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Western Plaguelands
  note 6029 is the same report addressed to the Horde and stays out of this Alliance route.
  accept 6603 -- Trouble in Winterspring! - Meggi Peppinrocker (60.66, 38.17); Meggi sends word to Donova Snowden in the west
  accept 6606 -- A Little Luck - Harlo Wigglesworth (61.12, 38.43); Harlo sends word to Witch Doctor Mau'ari
  accept 6604 -- Enraged Wildkin - Harlo Wigglesworth; Harlo sends word to Jaron Stoneshaper in the southwest

